      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Except they can't engage with you, they can't do anything to you.  Because you blocked them.\n\nThis is just incredibly silly and abusable, because how's this work in large instances with overlapping social circles?  Whoops, you can't hang out with your friends anymore, because you had one argument with someone in another friend group in the instance and they decided to be pissy and blocked you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
