      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{69bed226bcda4ee63244d35d|full_name}\n\nAside from still making it all about you, again, if they're hosting they have the means to eject them from the world so why not do just that?\n\nIf there is somehow someone who has genuine cause to make you feel unsafe in the instance engaging with people, you gotta wonder what's going on with your friends willing to actually talk to them (and why are they your friends still?) or just the general social circle involved and peace out for your own sake.\n\nSo it's still silly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
