  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-03-04T23:23:32.132Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "A feature where, when i create a friends + or private world, any person that i have blocked CAN NOT join my world.\n\nThe person would get a message saying “You don't have access to this instance”, or something like that.\n\nI feel like it creates a lot of bad and uncomfortable situations for a lot of people, if anything it happened to me last night and my friends,\n\nI just feel like this would be a nice feature to add, as it just breaks some privacy barriers as well as making the whole room into a drama show.",
